        <mxCell id="Ow565fYFMN9ClI8RAgHk-1" parent="gEPJv5nczazuLBSkl6x0-1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;backgroundOutline=1;fontColor=#000000;darkOpacity=0.05;fillColor=#FFF9B2;strokeColor=none;fillStyle=solid;direction=west;gradientDirection=north;gradientColor=#FFF2A1;shadow=1;size=20;autosizeText=1;fontSize=20;align=left;" value="&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;b&gt;Create and enrich:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;For &lt;b&gt;BetPlacement&lt;/b&gt; events,&amp;nbsp;there wont´be offering enrichment. Since BetPlaced event, offering data is included.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;For &lt;b&gt;BetSettlement&lt;/b&gt; events the enrichment is done from the last &quot;EnrichedEvent&quot;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;In next interations the enrichment will add user data, bet limits and other data.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;" vertex="1">
